{
  "_comment_architecture": [
    "MODEL-LEVEL textile passport in the CIRPASS-2 / EUDPP shape, carried by GS1 Digital Link (01/{GTIN}).",
    "Every block answers an EUDPP Core Ontology module with the OpenEPCIS/GS1 layering: identification incl. TARIC (eudpp IDENT / P_DPP -> GS1 Digital Link + oec:customsCommodityCode), manufacturer and tier-1 supply chain as GLN-identified parties (eudpp ACTOR -> oec:OperatorInformation/oec:FacilityInformation over 417/414 Digital Link), care-label composition (eudpp MAT -> gs1:textileMaterial, GS1 first), conformity (eudpp COMP -> oec:hasConformityDeclaration), and passport metadata incl. the ESPR Art. 10(4) backup host (eudpp P_DPP dppStatus/hasBackUpCopyHost -> oec:passportStatus/oec:hasBackupCopyHost).",
    "The alignment to the eudpp: terms is carried by the ontology (rdfs:seeAlso + audited SKOS in dpp-core.ttl), not by keys in this document — the document stays pure GS1 + oec:/eutex:.",
    "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234), GTIN 09521234006206."
  ],
